@startuml
title SC-ORD-011 — Paid, but the stock is not confirmed before the review delay
participant "Order\n(saga)" as O
participant "Inventory" as I
participant "Payment" as P
participant "Notification" as N

P ->> O : PaymentCaptured
note over O : CONFIRMING_STOCK
O ->> I : ConfirmReservation
note over I #ECEFF1 : down: the message waits\nin its subscription
... review deadline ...
O -> O : review deadline reached
note over O #FFF8E1 : SUSPENDED, remembers CONFIRMING_STOCK\norder UNDER_REVIEW, alert raised
O ->> N : OrderPutUnderReview
== the inventory is back ==
note over I : handles the ConfirmReservation\nthat was waiting
I ->> O : ReservationConfirmed
note over O : handled as in CONFIRMING_STOCK
note over O #C8E6C9 : COMPLETED\norder CONFIRMED
O ->> N : OrderConfirmed
@enduml
